==English==
{{wikipedia|Methamphetamine}}

===Etymology===
From {{prefix|en|meth|amphetamine}}; 1945–1950.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌmɛθæmˈfɛtəˌmiːn/|/ˌmɛθæmˈfɛtəˌmɪn/}}
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Vealhurl-methamphetamine.wav|a=Southern England}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A highly addictive [[phenethylamine]] [[stimulant]] [[drug]]. Its systematic (IUPAC) name is (S)-N-methyl-1-phenylpropan-2-amine.
#: {{syn|en|crank|crystal meth|ice|meth|methedrine|speed|Thesaurus:methamphetamine}}

